Description: Update jq to 1.8.2
 jq 1.7.1 has memory errors and crashes on crafted JSON input and programs.
 jq 1.8.0, 1.8.1 and 1.8.2 fix them, among them CVE-2024-23337,
 CVE-2025-48060, CVE-2026-32316, CVE-2026-33947, CVE-2026-33948 and
 CVE-2026-39956.
 .
 src/builtin.inc is made from 1.8.2's src/builtin.jq, as jq's Makefile.am
 makes it. jq.1 is 1.8.2's jq.1.prebuilt. The decNumber changes in 1.8.2
 fix comments only and are left out. Oniguruma stays at the version that
 text_cmds bundles.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/jqlang/jq/tree/jq-1.8.2
Last-Update: 2026-11-17

